WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.840
The boring company's $3 billion funding now backs Tesla-powered trucks hauling 20-foot containers underground. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 640, Intel's new process node, Japan's self-driving filing,

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:17.280
testing, Rivian's point-to-point assist, then first principles on shared hardware.

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.880
The boring company modified a Tesla Model 3 battery and drive unit for its latest proofrock

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.120
