00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:42.940
Fred has sat on the company's menu for years, and in 2021, its freight tunnel was described

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:45.680
as size to fit a standard shipping container barely.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:51.440
Proofrock 3 later dug a tunnel to gigatexas that now moves finished cybertrucks away from

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.260
the production line.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.720
The series decloased in September at a $23 billion valuation.

00:00:57.904 --> 00:01:01.884
Upcoming Tesla Silicon will run on Intel's 14A process node.

00:01:01.884 --> 00:01:07.144
