00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:57.801
Rivian will introduce a supervised point-to-point assist feature in the coming weeks, CarBuzz reports.

00:01:57.801 --> 00:02:03.241
The system requires drivers to remain attentive and is positioned as a software testing phase.

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:08.161
The feature will handle highway and surface street segments between user selected points.

00:02:08.801 --> 00:02:13.561
Rivian described the rollout as an early validation step before broader capability releases.

00:02:14.578 --> 00:02:20.438
The Model X took the top spot in its category in the inaugural Canadian Blackbook Retained Value Awards,

00:02:20.918 --> 00:02:22.918
