00:02:22.918 --> 00:02:28.558
The award recognizes the vehicle's strong resale performance relative to other models in the segment.

00:02:29.098 --> 00:02:35.238
Canadian Blackbook launched the retained value awards this year to highlight vehicles that hold value best after purchase.

00:02:35.858 --> 00:02:40.878
The Model X outperformed other SUVs and crossovers tracked in the Canadian market data set.

00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:44.898
No other Tesla model received an award in the first edition of the list.

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:50.805
A Florida homeowner selected EG-4 battery systems after comparing costs for hurricane

00:02:50.805 --> 00:02:56.285
