00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:03.985
The homeowner calculated that EG-4 units provided equivalent capacity at roughly half the

00:03:03.985 --> 00:03:06.545
installed cost of a comparable power wall setup.

00:03:07.145 --> 00:03:12.265
Local installers confirmed the EG-4 systems met Florida building codes for storm-hardened

00:03:12.265 --> 00:03:13.265
