00:04:31.739 --> 00:04:37.099
OpenAI is developing humanoid robots to take on Tesla and other robotics companies.

00:04:37.579 --> 00:04:38.659
Why Net News reports.

00:04:39.439 --> 00:04:43.579
Sam Altman has set a target for the first demonstration in 2027.

00:04:44.159 --> 00:04:48.939
The effort marks OpenAI's direct entry into hardware development alongside its existing

00:04:48.939 --> 00:04:50.219
AI software work.

00:04:50.659 --> 00:04:55.839
The timeline places OpenAI's first hardware showing one year ahead of several announced Tesla

00:04:55.839 --> 00:04:57.039
Optimus Milestones.

00:04:57.039 --> 00:05:03.051
TSL aiming noted that development cycles have compressed from 4 years to 18 months across

00:05:03.051 --> 00:05:03.771
the industry.

00:05:04.191 --> 00:05:08.951
The shorter timelines force companies to skip durability validation steps that previously

00:05:08.951 --> 00:05:11.031
caught mechanical issues before launch.

00:05:11.771 --> 00:05:16.611
Regulators now require two winters and one summer of physical testing to offset the reduced

00:05:16.611 --> 00:05:17.771
internal validation.

00:05:18.471 --> 00:05:23.471
The post frames the change as a direct response to repeated field failures in recently launched

00:05:23.471 --> 00:05:23.911
vehicles.

00:05:23.911 --> 00:05:29.071
The move fast and break things approach works for mobile apps, but not for vehicles carrying

00:05:29.071 --> 00:05:31.191
families at highway speeds, Ming said.

00:05:31.951 --> 00:05:36.651
The post supports regulatory moves that ban unproven features such as moving bed modes

00:05:36.651 --> 00:05:38.811
until full physical testing is complete.

00:05:39.451 --> 00:05:44.311
It argues that real-world durability cannot be validated through software simulation alone.

00:05:45.329 --> 00:05:49.929
Our Invest updated its model to project Tesla shares reaching levels implying nearly

00:05:49.929 --> 00:05:56.109
